{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And these are the names.</b> Those mentioned here were worthy of being identified by name, for each one was worthy of being counted as a man of his name — which indicates his personal form. And all the days of their lives they were as luminaries, and the generation did not descend into evil proliferation. However, after their death, the righteous among their children were not so distinguished in the eyes of Elohim and man."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:23:54.345172672Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}